OL,3,GNEWSAMore fly-tipping fines as number
OL,4,Aof cases rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of fly-tipping incidents in
OL,7,Fthe north of a county has increased by
OL,8,Falmost 25% in one year, with more fines
OL,9,Falso being issued.
OL,11,FNorth Northamptonshire Council recorded
OL,12,F8,330 fly-tips between July 2025 and
OL,13,FJune 2026, compared with 6,676 the
OL,14,Fprevious year.
OL,16,FThe council told the Local Democracy
OL,17,FReporting Service that the increase was
OL,18,Fpartly linked to improved reporting.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
