OL,3,GNEWSAMore fly-tipping fines as number
OL,4,Aof cases rise
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are working to develop a more
OL,7,Fintelligence-led approach to
OL,8,Fenvironmental crime, including greater
OL,9,Fuse of data analysis and technology
OL,10,Fthat could support both prevention and
OL,11,Fenforcement activity," a council
OL,12,Fspokesperson said.
